{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Space Dandy 2","Space Dandy is a dandy guy, in space! This dreamy adventurer with a to-die-for pompadour travels across the galaxy in search of aliens no one has ever laid eyes on. Each new species he discovers earns him a hefty reward, but this dandy has to be quick on his feet because it's first come, first served! Accompanied by his sidekicks, a rundown robot named QT and Meow the cat-looking space alien, Dandy bravely explores unknown worlds inhabited by a variety of aliens. Join the best dressed alien hunter in all of space and time as he embarks on an adventure that ends at the edge of the universe!\n\n\n\n(Source: Bandai Visual)"],"ja":["スペース☆ダンディ 2",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":20057,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-23327","ids":{"shikimori":23327,"mal":23327,"anilist":20666,"kodik":"serial-22033"},"kodikIds":["serial-6896","serial-20435","serial-22033"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6896":"2019-11-16T13:51:23Z","serial-20435":"2019-12-26T11:29:19Z","serial-22033":"2020-01-30T22:36:46Z"},"title":"Космический Денди 2","originalTitle":"Space Dandy 2","alt":"スペース☆ダンディ 2 Space Dandy 2 スペース☆ダンディ 2","description":"Продолжение приключений самого везучего охотника на пришельцев во Вселенной — Денди. Вместе со своей бравой командой, состоящей из кота Мяу и робота QT, и немалым запасом приключений, он смело исследует космос на наличие ещё не открытых ранее пришельцев. Эта команда может ненароком уничтожить планету или спасти её от войны, по пути посетив любимый ресторан «Груди».","year":2014,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","Фантастика","взрослые персонажи","космос"],"rating":8.27,"popularity":45163,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[20057],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/23327/b6dae7d026a7b12cd22908b13a27fc88.jpeg","width":700,"height":995},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20666-MPlCqhcmB2H4.jpg","width":1280,"height":1626}},"releas